        "title": "The app is free. So what am I paying for?",
        "body": "<p>Fair. You can download Clippar today, prop your phone against your bag, and it will find your swings and trim them for nothing. That is not a trial and it does not expire.</p><p>What you are buying is the difference between doing that once and doing it every Saturday. <strong>A mount that actually grips a buggy rail</strong> over eighteen holes of corrugations. <strong>A clicker on your belt</strong>, so you are not walking back to your bag between shots. <strong>A battery</strong>, because filming is the thing that flattens a phone by the fifteenth.</p><p>None of it is exotic. It is just the specific set of things you would otherwise buy separately, from three different places, over about a month — and one of them would be wrong.</p>",
        "tone": "dark"
      }
    },
