        "title": "It's one bloke in Brisbane",
        "body": "<p>I built Clippar because I kept finishing rounds with nothing to show for them. The good shots happen, everyone agrees they happened, and then they are gone.</p><p>There is no warehouse and no support team — it is me. That is worth knowing before you pre-order, because it means the December date is an honest forecast rather than a logistics department's promise, and if it moves you will hear it from me directly.</p><p>It also means you can cancel any time before your kit ships and get everything back, no form and no argument. I would rather refund you than have you wait on something you have stopped wanting.</p>",
